Description: web browser
 Web browser that aims to build a safer, faster, and more stable internet
 browsing experience.
 .
 This package contains the web browser component.
 .
 This build has no X11 support at all: the browser runs under Wayland or
 headless only. Hardware video acceleration (VA-API) is available and does
 not require X11.

Package: chromium-ru
Architecture: all
Section: localization
Depends:
 ${misc:Depends},
 chromium (>= ${source:Version}),
 chromium (<< ${source:Version}.1~),
Description: web browser - Russian language pack
 Web browser that aims to build a safer, faster, and more stable internet
 browsing experience.
 .
 This package contains the Russian localization of the browser interface:
 the message catalogs ru.pak plus the gender variants ru_FEMININE.pak,
 ru_MASCULINE.pak and ru_NEUTER.pak.
 .
 Unlike Debian's chromium-l10n, which ships 54 languages (~118 MB installed),
 this package carries Russian only (~2.4 MB). Other locales are not built at
 all - see packages/chromium/README.md.

